            "            PipeBarrier<PIPE_V>();",
            "            DataCopy(curValueIdxUb, tmpUb, BASE_TOPK_VALUE_IDX_SIZE);",
            "            PipeBarrier<PIPE_V>();",
            "        }"
          ]
        },
